     1380      DO:
     1381         sch-code:screen-value = sch-code:screen-value + last-event:label.
     1382         apply "entry" to sch-code in frame Dialog-Frame.
     1383         apply "end" to sch-code in frame Dialog-Frame.
     1384      END.
     1385   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF BR-docs IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1386      DO:
